!!! oculus/compositor/surface.mat
!!! Pixel buffer abstraction for the compositor.
!!!
!!! A surface is a rectangular region of pixels — the fundamental unit
!!! of composition. Surfaces can be the framebuffer itself, a window
!!! backing store, or a cached texture.

book oculus.compositor.surface

read everything from oculus.window.geometry
read everything from ny.lang.core

!!! A pixel surface with dimensions and format.

public surface begin record
    field width as override long
    field height as override long
    field pixel-format as text
end record
